1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:25.710
We, the pirates from Whitebeard's Second Division, will save Commander Ace!

3
00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:26.900
Yeah!

4
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:28.470
Stop this!

5
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.240
Why are you all doing this for me?!

6
00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:38.340
I'm your little brother!

7
00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:44.300
You're so stupid, Luffy...

8
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.430
You too, Old Man!

9
00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:49.590
Become my son!

10
00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:06.330
What is it?

11
00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:10.430
I'm...

12
00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:15.650
... ready to accept whatever the future has in store for me.

13
00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.060
I'll take the outstretched hand that saves me...

14
00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:24.400
... or bow to the blade that punishes me.

15
00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:31.390
I'm...

16
00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:33.740
... not going to fight it anymore.

17
00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:40.210
I'm sorry, everyone.

18
00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:19.200
Resume the attack!

19
00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.470
Fire!

20
00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:27.080
Rubber-Rubber...

21
00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:28.880
... Balloon!

22
00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:34.860
<b>The Prisoners of Impel Down</b>

23
00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:39.370
Right away, he's the center of attention!

24
00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:41.590
That Straw Hat!

25
00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:45.970
Captain Buggy! We can't let him outshine us!

26
00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:48.730
Let's take Whitebeard's head already!

27
00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:51.480
Very well, my friends! Let's do this!

28
00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:58.230
But still, what's up with this crazy battlefield?

29
00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:01.410
The marines and pirates here are all world-renowned!

30
00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:04.310
It'd be better if I just lay low here...

31
00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:06.870
Hey, Red-Nose!

32
00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:09.260
Who're you callin' Red-Nose, you bastard?!

33
00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:11.770
You wanna die or somethin'?!

34
00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:18.530
Whitebeard?!

35
00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:20.880
I thought I'd seen you somewhere before...

36
00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:23.700
You're that brat who was on Roger's ship, aren't you?

37
00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:27.570
That sure takes me back... So you're still alive?

38
00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:31.110
Oh, crap! He's spotted me. I'm gonna die!

39
00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:34.550
We're done for! We have no choice but to run!

40
00:05:34.550 --> 00:05:38.180
W-Whitebeard! The great Whitebeard...

41
00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:40.540
talked to the Captain! Amazing!

42
00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:43.760
You really are a legendary pirate!

43
00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:46.950
Don't act so impressed!

44
00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:49.560
You'll catch the same hell as me!

45
00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:52.750
Judging from all the prisoners you've brought along...

46
00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:56.300
I suppose you've come to take my head?

47
00:05:56.300 --> 00:06:00.230
Sure! Long time no see, huh? Now prepare yourself!

48
00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:06.540
There's a limit to how far you can take this!

49
00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:13.520
Really, now? I don't mind if you wanna take my head, but what're you gonna do afterward?

50
00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:17.520
The Navy's forces are far too big for you to handle.

51
00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:21.700
Actually, they're a bit much for me too. I've got my hands full here.

52
00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:27.000
So, you wanna join up with me, and we'll take out the Navy as fellow pirates?

53
00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:30.470
You can take my head after that.

54
00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:36.510
Hang on a second! How much respect does Whitebeard have for you?

55
00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:38.080
It's like they're equals!

56
00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:41.350
I don't think he'd refer to his equal as a brat...

57
00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:45.550
It's reckless of you to try and fight the Navy! Do you really think we can win?!

58
00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:49.550
Well, if I get serious, yeah...

59
00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:53.360
What happened to his common sense?

60
00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:54.760
Seriously?

61
00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:56.330
Ooh, I'm getting goosebumps!

62
00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:58.400
I'm starting to feel like I can do this!

63
00:06:58.400 --> 00:06:59.150
I can do it!

64
00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:02.870
I can see it now! Buggy, king of the world!

65
00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:08.540
If the two of us join forces, we can crush the Navy.

66
00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:13.130
Please, stop it! You're so cool! Too cool!

67
00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:15.970
Alright, Whitebeard! We'll back you up!

68
00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:18.270
I will back you up!

69
00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:20.710
Who is he?!

70
00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:23.720
That's right! He's our Captain Buggy!

71
00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:27.660
I can't believe how simple-minded these guys are.

72
00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:33.250
Disregarding Red-Nose, the others behind him are pretty strong.

73
00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:35.600
It'd be a pain to have to fight them.

74
00:07:39.030 --> 00:07:41.590
So, now...

75
00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:51.750
This is Whitebeard.

76
00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:53.720
Is Squard there?

77
00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:56.460
Old Man! Captain Squard is...

78
00:07:56.460 --> 00:08:00.750
Huh? He was here a minute ago...

79
00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:01.930
Seems we've lost sight of him.

80
00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:07.740
He got carried away trying to impress you, Old Man...

81
00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:12.260
That's too bad. Then, DeCalvan Brothers!

82
00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:14.360
What is it, Old Man?

83
00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:15.770
Old Man, what should we do?

84
00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:20.140
Take command of all the pirate crews, and pass my orders on to them!

85
00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:26.560
What? The Old Man? Alright, then I'll start on the right.

86
00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:29.330
We'll take the left.

87
00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:31.040
Sure. Got it.

88
00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:34.180
We'll go to the right.

89
00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:36.730
If that's what the Old Man wants...

90
00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:40.200
My ship will go anywhere you want it to.

91
00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:44.500
Squard? I don't see him anywhere... Is that right?

92
00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:48.170
I'll go to the left.

93
00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:54.520
Fleet Admiral Sengoku! The New World pirates are changing their attack pattern!

94
00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:57.350
Yeah, they've scattered off in every direction.

95
00:08:57.730 --> 00:09:00.790
They've started attacking the warships!

96
00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:19.220
Well played, Whitebeard! He saw it coming.

97
00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.740
Seems he's not falling for such an obvious trick.

98
00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:24.980
I suppose I was too crude.

99
00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:29.950
But sharp intuition won't be enough to stop fate!

100
00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:38.260
You're kidding. Moriah's up against "Knight of the Sea", Jinbe?!

101
00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:41.430
The Seven Warlords of the Sea are a vital part of our defense!

102
00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:43.640
What good is it if they just kill each other?!

103
00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:48.170
I'm more than a match for you, Moriah!

104
00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:51.330
You wanna fight me, Jinbe?

105
00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:57.040
Very well! I can't use my Zombie Warriors with you around, after all!

106
00:09:57.040 --> 00:10:00.750
Keep moving, Luffy-kun! Don't waste any more time!

107
00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:02.680
Thanks, Jinbe!

108
00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:04.650
Our shadows are acting strange.

109
00:10:08.180 --> 00:10:13.420
Marine shadows, give me your strength!

110
00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:32.310
Now then, I'll be taking your shadow!

111
00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:39.480
You'll spend eternity in the gloom at the bottom of the sea, Jinbe!

112
00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:44.560
Hand over your shadow!

113
00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:49.500
Fishman Karate...

114
00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:55.600
Sharkskin Palm Block!

115
00:11:02.630 --> 00:11:05.840
Shark Brick True Fist!

116
00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:22.680
All that work and your shadows have left you...

117
00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:24.730
You don't have enough skill.

118
00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:28.160
Now step aside, Moriah.

119
00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:30.130
I'm in a hurry.

120
00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:33.600
Wait, dammit! The battle isn't over!

121
00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:47.410
It's Straw Hat!

122
00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:52.850
Get out of the way, Tashigi!

123
00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:01.670
That hurt! You're...

124
00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:02.940
Smokie!

125
00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:08.030
That's right! His jutte has seastone inside of it!

126
00:12:08.030 --> 00:12:09.100
Damn you...

127
00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:11.100
Gear Second!

128
00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:15.510
I will finish you!

129
00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:17.510
Rubber-Rubber...

130
00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:21.990
... Jet Gatling!

131
00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:23.920
White Launcher!

132
00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:27.660
He's a lot stronger than before!

133
00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:29.460
Straw Hat!

134
00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:32.160
He disappeared!

135
00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:34.300
He's fast! Where'd he go?

136
00:12:48.070 --> 00:12:52.180
It seems we've both grown stronger since we last met.

137
00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:04.740
You can't defeat me with your ability.

138
00:13:04.740 --> 00:13:07.870
Damn, it's that... jutte...

139
00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:10.850
I finally understand...

140
00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:14.500
... why Dragon saved you...

141
00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:17.440
.... back in Loguetown. Straw Hat.

142
00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:23.550
Dragon got in my way back then, but this time, you're not getting away!

143
00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:25.650
D-Damn it...

144
00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:27.960
Get your filthy hands off him!

145
00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:32.190
She managed to hit me, even though I'm smoke...

146
00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:35.390
But kicks shouldn't touch him...

147
00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:38.170
That's...

148
00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:41.300
The Pirate Empress protected Straw Hat!

149
00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:44.290
Hancock! What are you playing at?!

150
00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:46.240
Do you intend to quit being a Warlord, too?

151
00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:47.210
Silence!

152
00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:50.690
I am so infuriated, I don't care what you say!

153
00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:55.480
How dare you beat and hold down my dearest?!

154
00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:59.510
I will not let you live!

155
00:13:59.510 --> 00:14:02.920
I have never been this angry before!

156
00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:06.220
I will rip you apart and feed you to a beast!

157
00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:09.430
So that was the Haki of the Kuja Tribe...

158
00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:13.240
Hancock!

159
00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.830
Yes!

160
00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:18.670
You called me "Hancock" again!

161
00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:23.570
Kuma! Kuma, come to vyour senses!

162
00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:27.990
It's vme! Have vyou forgotten vmy face?!

163
00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:30.230
Come to vyour senses, or Vi will fight back!

164
00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:31.950
There's a limit to how much Vi can take!

165
00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:36.000
I don't know what sort of history you two have,

166
00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.560
but just give it up.

167
00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:42.830
There's no point in talking to him, Emporio Ivankov, Commander of the Revolutionary Army.

168
00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:44.130
Vyou're...

169
00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:46.760
What are vyou saying?! What's going on?!

170
00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:51.770
The man you know was probably named Bartholomew Kuma, right?

171
00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:56.710
If you're thinking of the man once called Kuma the Tyrant...

172
00:14:57.310 --> 00:14:59.740
... he's long dead.

173
00:15:01.050 --> 00:15:03.080
What are vyou talking about?!

174
00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:10.720
Kuma...

175
00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:12.600
... is dead?!

176
00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:24.100
W-What's going on? Why did
the Pirate Empress protect Straw Hat?

177
00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:31.760
Take this.

178
00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:35.580
This is the key to your brother's handcuffs.

179
00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:46.020
Luffy's hand... Luffy's hand...

180
00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:47.860
... touched mine!

181
00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:50.260
Hancock!

182
00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:55.730
You're the best! You're the best!

183
00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:01.970
Thanks a lot! I owe you one!

184
00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:05.060
I-It's alright! It's alright!

185
00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:06.780
Do not worry about it, just...

186
00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:08.980
... just keep moving forward, Luffy!

187
00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.400
Oh, yeah!

188
00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:12.910
Thanks!

189
00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:23.520
No way! The Pirate Empress was defeated?!

190
00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:27.770
He crushed her attack! He must have countered it with Sumo wrestling!

191
00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:31.950
So this is what I heard so much about...

192
00:16:33.060 --> 00:16:34.550
Marriage!

193
00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:38.560
Perfume Femur!

194
00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:57.860
Insolent one! I shall not let you past me!

195
00:16:57.860 --> 00:17:01.050
Look at that! It's her Extreme Looking-Down Pose!

196
00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:03.930
She's looking so far down her nose, she looks up instead!

197
00:17:03.930 --> 00:17:09.440
Don't you know what'll happen if you get in the Navy's way?

198
00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:13.280
No matter what I do, I shall be forgiven...

199
00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:17.250
... for I am beautiful!

200
00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:20.570
I'm really grateful for this! I owe her another one!

201
00:17:21.590 --> 00:17:24.120
What'd you say?! Kuma is dead?!

202
00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:27.460
Then who's the man standing in front of vme?

203
00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:30.710
He's clearly alive! Don't be ridiculous!

204
00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:33.060
Iva-chan!

205
00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:36.770
It's that guy that looks like a bear!
Kuma: Bear

206
00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:48.390
Iva-chan, do you know him?

207
00:17:48.390 --> 00:17:51.880
Yeah... But he's acting strange.

208
00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:59.030
It seems like the two of you have memories of Kuma,

209
00:17:59.030 --> 00:18:01.290
but the Kuma you know, and this guy,

210
00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:04.230
are two different people!

211
00:18:04.870 --> 00:18:07.160
Different people? What's he talking about?

212
00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:12.960
That's not possible! This is, without a doubt, the man who ate the Paw-Paw Fruit.

213
00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:15.910
He's definitely Kuma! Speak to vme, Kuma!

214
00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:22.970
It's useless, just like I've been saying. It doesn't matter how much you try to talk to him.

215
00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:25.320
The other day,

216
00:18:26.570 --> 00:18:31.810
... the Government's head scientist, Doctor Vegapunk, completed his final modifications on him...

217
00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:36.630
... and transformed him into a perfect human weapon.

218
00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:41.470
In other words, this isn't Bartholomew Kuma anymore!

219
00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:45.270
Modifications? A weapon? What are vyou talking about?!

220
00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:47.330
Basically, he was selected...

221
00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:54.050
... by the Government's human weapon project to be a test subject. He volunteered for it himself.

222
00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:56.610
They started with his arms...

223
00:18:56.610 --> 00:18:58.650
... then his legs...

224
00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:01.020
Leaving his consciousness intact,

225
00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:06.270
the scientists replaced his body parts piece by piece, over a long period of time.

226
00:19:07.530 --> 00:19:12.130
Stop lying! Kuma hates the World Government!

227
00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:15.170
He would never...

228
00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:18.440
... offer his own life to the Government!

229
00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:25.440
Well, I don't know what kind of deal this guy had with the Government.

230
00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:32.880
A couple of days ago, there was definitely some human left in him.

231
00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:42.040
But now, he's lost all memory of being born human. He's as good as dead.

232
00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:45.830
He's become a monster who only fights according to the Government's orders.

233
00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:50.300
The Pacifista, PX-0!

234
00:19:50.300 --> 00:19:53.200
The past is gone, you should just forget it!

235
00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:11.490
Kuma! What happened to vyour body these past few years?!

236
00:20:12.990 --> 00:20:15.390
Now that I think about it...

237
00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:19.050
We will never meet again.

238
00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:21.400
Farewell.

239
00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:24.340
That's the last thing he said to me...

240
00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:27.560
What's wrong, Kuma? It's vme! Ivankov!

241
00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:31.080
W-Where is he? Where did he go?

242
00:20:34.950 --> 00:20:37.750
He's dangerous, you guys! Be careful!

243
00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:41.350
Pad Cannon

244
00:20:54.030 --> 00:20:56.930
Damn vyou, Kuma!

245
00:20:59.140 --> 00:21:00.400
Face...

246
00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:02.400
... Spectrum!

247
00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:08.230
Vyou scared yet?

248
00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:14.900
Galaxy Wink!

249
00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:40.680
How dare vyou attack vmy adorable Candies?!

250
00:21:40.680 --> 00:21:44.250
Don't think Vi will hold back any longer!

251
00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:46.220
Take this!

252
00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:56.370
He sure is strong!

253
00:21:57.280 --> 00:21:59.710
This is the first time anyone Vi have met has...

254
00:22:00.430 --> 00:22:04.800
...forgotten...

255
00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:10.570
... forgotten vmy face! That has never happened to vme before!

256
00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:13.370
Oh... Yeah...

257
00:22:13.370 --> 00:22:14.650
However!

258
00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:18.320
Vi don't know if it's because vyour memories are gone,

259
00:22:18.320 --> 00:22:21.960
but if vyou have even forgotten how terrifying Vi can be...

260
00:22:21.960 --> 00:22:24.620
... then Vi will just beat the fear back into vyour body!

261
00:22:25.340 --> 00:22:27.530
Prepare yourself!

262
00:22:29.300 --> 00:22:31.560
He sure recovered quickly...

263
00:22:31.560 --> 00:22:33.310
Vi will take care of him.

264
00:22:33.310 --> 00:22:37.580
Vyou all, go help Straw-Hat-boy!

265
00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:38.670
Roger that!

266
00:22:39.840 --> 00:22:41.770
Now, let's go, Straw Hat!

267
00:22:42.550 --> 00:22:44.680
Thanks for the help, Iva-chan!

268
00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.180
Head for the execution platform!

269
00:22:47.180 --> 00:22:51.520
Yeah!

270
00:22:52.990 --> 00:22:55.790
Damn that cheeky Straw Hat!

271
00:22:55.790 --> 00:22:57.240
Don't let him get too far ahead!

272
00:22:57.240 --> 00:23:02.140
It's time to put Operation: "Make Captain Buggy Famous" into action!

273
00:23:02.140 --> 00:23:03.390
Yeah!

274
00:23:03.390 --> 00:23:06.920
If we succeed, the entire world will be forced to acknowledge my awesomeness!

275
00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:10.730
Don't fall behind, and carry out my plan!

276
00:23:14.560 --> 00:23:18.030
Will this plan really work?

277
00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:25.830
Crocodile!

278
00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:27.570
There's no end to them!

279
00:23:31.390 --> 00:23:33.340
I was thrown pretty far from him...

280
00:23:35.170 --> 00:23:37.090
We're not letting you get anywhere near the Old Man!

281
00:23:37.090 --> 00:23:38.840
Don't get...

282
00:23:40.200 --> 00:23:41.450
... in my way!

283
00:23:44.190 --> 00:23:48.170
What a troublesome fellow... He just won't give up.

284
00:23:49.130 --> 00:23:51.400
Brilliant Punk!

285
00:24:04.050 --> 00:24:06.820
He's so big and fast...

286
00:24:06.820 --> 00:24:08.430
Here he comes again.

287
00:24:08.430 --> 00:24:11.500
The Commander of the Third Division, Diamond Jozu.

288
00:24:23.230 --> 00:24:26.730
I'm impressed you got out, Croc-man.

289
00:24:26.730 --> 00:24:29.650
How was your bath in the pond of blood?

290
00:24:29.650 --> 00:24:35.790
Doflamingo. Don't interfere. You wanna die?

291
00:24:35.790 --> 00:24:38.290
What an unpleasant thing to say...

292
00:24:38.290 --> 00:24:41.460
How 'bout it? Wanna team up with me?

293
00:24:44.260 --> 00:24:45.200
You think you're getting past?

294
00:24:45.200 --> 00:24:47.200
Think you can stop us?

295
00:24:47.200 --> 00:24:48.400
Go, Straw Hat!

296
00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:51.200
Thanks!

297
00:25:05.300 --> 00:25:07.180
Forgive me, Red Hair...

298
00:25:09.680 --> 00:25:12.390
I will not go easy on him.

299
00:25:14.730 --> 00:25:16.190
That's...!

300
00:25:20.210 --> 00:25:21.130
... Hawk Eye!

301
00:25:27.600 --> 00:25:29.770
Now then, fate.

302
00:25:30.450 --> 00:25:35.210
Will the life of a promised child from the next generation... end here?

303
00:25:35.510 --> 00:25:40.430
If not, how will he escape from this Black Blade?

304
00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:15.880 line:8% position:5% align:start size:45%
<c.credits>Editing, Sewil</c>

305
00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:21.220 line:8% position:5% align:start size:45%
<c.credits>QC, Galaxy 9000, Pepperjack</c>

306
00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:27.790 line:8% position:5% align:start size:45%
<c.credits>Karaoke, KaitouYahiko</c>

307
00:02:27.860 --> 00:02:31.660 line:8% position:5% align:start size:45%
<c.credits>Timing, Galaxy 9000</c>
